    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really sharp pain in my right side that keeps shooting down into my groin area. it's super intense and came on kind of fast. i've had kidney stones before so i'm thinking it's that, but i also feel this weird rhythmic pulsing in my stomach area when i'm still. i looked it up and it says a pulsing belly can be an aneurysm sign which is freaking me out. is it just the stones or should i be worried about something else?",
